  ── Add a host ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── step 2 of 6 ──

    Testing raspberry

    ○ host key    not in your known_hosts

    raspberry shows the host key SHA256:kkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkk, which your known_hosts does not
    name. Check it on the machine first:

      ssh-keygen -lf /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key.pub

    Pin it only if they match. Every connection then checks it.

    enter pin this key   esc back
